entries[133810] = { ["name"] = "Recipe: Salt and Pepper Shank", ["text"] = "Rank 1\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nUse: Teaches you how to cook Salt and Pepper Shank.\nPrepare Salt and Pepper Shank.\nRequires Legion Cooking (1)\nSell Price:\nSalt and Pepper Shank\nUse: Restores 28846 health and 14423 mana over 20 sec. Must remain seated while eating. If you spend at least 10 seconds eating you will become well fed and gain 8 Critical Strike for 1 hour.\nSell Price:\nRequires Lean Shank (5), Flaked Sea Salt (2), Dalapeño Pepper (2)" }
