entries[133828] = { ["name"] = "Recipe: Fighter Chow", ["text"] = "Rank 1\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nUse: Teaches you how to cook Fighter Chow.\nPrepare Fighter Chow.\nRequires Legion Cooking (1)\nSell Price:\nFighter Chow\nUse: Restores 28846 health and 14423 mana over 20 sec. Must remain seated while eating. If you spend at least 10 seconds eating you will become well fed and while out of combat heal for 112 every 5 sec for 1 hour.\nSell Price:\nRequires Cursed Queenfish (5), Royal Olive" }
