entries[133948] = { ["name"] = "Fists of the Heavens", ["text"] = "Alra'ed\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nOff Hand Fist Weapon\n2 - 3 Damage Speed 2.60\n(1.0 damage per second)\n+1 Agility\n+2 Stamina\n+ 1 Critical Strike\n+ 1 Mastery\nClasses: Monk\n\"There was a great flash of light and a great rush of air, and when it was done, Irmaat could feel his weapons, Al'burq and Alra'ed trembling with elemental power.\"\nSell Price:" }
